WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,180 --> 00:00:02,980
But as a mother, I have always been worried

2
00:00:02,980 --> 00:00:04,380
Got it?

3
00:00:04,380 --> 00:00:06,180
I'm doing my rotation these days

4
00:00:06,180 --> 00:00:08,380
I will go to Wucheng to see her tomorrow

5
00:00:08,380 --> 00:00:15,900
Good morning, three beauties

6
00:00:15,900 --> 00:00:17,530
Why didn't you sleep more?

7
00:00:17,530 --> 00:00:19,610
Sister Qingqing really dares to drive it

8
00:00:19,610 --> 00:00:22,010
We are afraid to drive a Ferrari to school

9
00:00:22,010 --> 00:00:23,210
Too garish

10
00:00:23,210 --> 00:00:25,610
Afraid of being watched and pointed at by counselors and classmates

11
00:00:25,610 --> 00:00:27,210
The boss slept late last night

12
00:00:27,210 --> 00:00:29,010
I'm still resting in the master bedroom right now.

13
00:00:29,010 --> 00:00:31,810
When you go back to the villa, don't wake her up. Ouch

14
00:00:31,810 --> 00:00:33,210
Didn't sleep well last night

15
00:00:33,410 --> 00:00:36,410
Has Secretary Zhao made the boss work too hard?

16
00:00:36,410 --> 00:00:37,410
So what

17
00:00:37,410 --> 00:00:38,810
Stop being so sarcastic here

18
00:00:38,810 --> 00:00:40,810
My boss likes to drag me back to the master bedroom

19
00:00:40,810 --> 00:00:42,810
Don't even touch other women

20
00:00:42,810 --> 00:00:44,410
No matter how charming you, Director Liu Qing, look

21
00:00:44,410 --> 00:00:46,740
I can only stare from the side, haha

22
00:00:46,740 --> 00:00:48,540
I'm just caring about my colleagues

23
00:00:48,540 --> 00:00:50,140
Secretary Zhao is busy with studies during the day

24
00:00:50,140 --> 00:00:51,540
Handle company business in the evening
